agnosis, estrangement, miscarriage, and the loss of a future you had assumed. Any of those can produce the full physical weight of mourning."}],"$L20"],"$L21"]}]}]]}],"$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29"]}]]}]
